    "detail": {
      "id": 4321033,
      "name": "[Fragile][Soldier 0 - Anby] Thunder Strike - Lv.50",
      "desc": "Soldier 0 - Anby's personal Tactical Prism.\n\"Etheric Phantom - Scorpse\" deals 30% increased DMG to Bosses. When there are 1/2/3 Defense Force Faction characters in the squad, Aftershocks from the whole squad's Agents deal 30%/50%/50% increased DMG to Bosses.\nAfter Soldier 0 - Anby launches <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack: Azure Flash]</color>, she can press <IconMap:Icon_Normal> to chain into the fifth hit of <color=#FFFFFF>[Basic Attack: Penetrating Shock]</color>, <color=#FFFFFF>[Silver Star]</color>'s <color=#2BAD00>Charge Efficiency increases by 15%</color>, and each stack of <color=#FFFFFF>[White Thunder]</color> gained triggers one instance of <color=#FFFFFF>[White Thunder]</color>'s additional DMG, which deals <color=#2BAD00>extra DMG equal to 500% of her ATK</color>. <color=#FFFFFF>[White Thunder]</color>'s additional DMG triggered this way will not trigger <color=#FFFFFF>[Special Attack: Thunder Smite]</color>.",
